        <media:description><![CDATA[Lake Corpus Christi&#039;s water level had risen to nearly 92% of capacity on Aug. 15, 2026, after dropping to 10.6% six months earlier amid a lingering drought.]]></media:description>
        <media:thumbnail url="https://i0.wp.com/www.texastribune.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260815-Lake-Corpus-Christi-PG-06.jpg?fit=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1" width="1024" height="683"/>
